resolution: Work completed and released in 2026.6.7. Release attribution set explicitly so pm-changelog --respect-item-release files the entry under 2026.6.7 rather than the current Unreleased section.
expected_result: "A closed item whose changelog entry appears under the 2026.6.7 heading it actually shipped in, leaving the Unreleased section untouched."
actual_result: "Before this change the item sat in_progress since 2026-06-07 with no activity, so the work was invisible to the changelog while still counting as open work in every fleet audit."
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-06-07T07:41:36.337Z",codex-5.3-full-cycle,"Hardening pass complete: release:check succeeded after dependency bump and changelog regeneration."
  "2026-06-07T08:00:41.688Z",codex-5.3-full-cycle,"Security gate: high-confidence token/key regex scan over tracked files and git history found no actionable secrets. Binary-history false positives were traced to embedded wasm base64 blobs, not credentials."
