close_reason: "Retired as shipped. The full-cycle hardening wave for pm-csv completed on 2026-06-07 and shipped in release 2026.6.7 that same day; the item was simply never closed, leaving it in progress for seven weeks and inflating the fleet stale-item count."
body: Master execution item for full-cycle hardening in pm-csv.
